          "_name": "article04",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"start article4\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/img-20260216.png\" alt=\"NLP COACH PRAVEEN \">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>🧭 My Mission</b></h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Hi, I’m Praveen Singh — </b><br><b>🧠 NLP Expert &amp; Subconscious Mind Coach\n<br>📚 Author | Speaker | Transformation Coach</b><br>💰<b>&nbsp;For Wealth &amp; Investing: </b><a href=\"https://wealth.praveenworld.com/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\" style>wealth.praveenworld.com</a><br>👉 <a href=\"https://wealth.praveenworld.com/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>wealth.praveenworld.com</b></a><br><br>I'm the <b>CEO &amp; Founder of \"PRAVEEN WORLD</b>\" —\n<br>Welcome to Your Transformation Zone.\n<br>\n<br>I help ambitious individuals reprogram their \n<br>subconscious mind, master NLP-based mindset tools, \n<br>and unlock a powerful inner shift that leads to \n<br>clarity, confidence, and calm success.\n<br>\n<br>My work integrates the deep science of:\n<br>✅ Neuro-Linguistic Programming (NLP)\n<br>✅ Subconscious Mind Reprogramming\n<br>✅ Spiritual Psychology\n<br>✅ Brain Development &amp; Student Performance\n<br>\n<br>This isn't just about motivation — it's about \n<br>becoming the best version of yourself.\n<br>\n<br>Over the years, I've guided thousands to:\n<br>✅ Overcome inner blocks &amp; limiting beliefs\n<br>✅ Build an unshakeable growth mindset\n<br>✅ Overcome Anxiety, Phobia &amp; Depression\n<br>✅ Achieve holistic success — mentally &amp; spiritually\n<br>\n<br>Everything I teach is rooted in what has personally \n<br>transformed my life — and is now transforming others'.\n<br>\n<br>Ready to rewire your mind and live life on your terms?\n<br>Let's begin your breakthrough. 🚀<br><br>⚠️ Results may vary from person to person based on individual effort, consistency, and circumstances. This program is intended for educational and self-development purposes only and does not guarantee specific outcomes.<br><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-success\" href=\"https://rzp.io/l/a2rs19FfhP\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">BOOK A Appointment</a> <a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-success\" href=\"https://wealth.praveenworld.com/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">💰 Build Your Wealth</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
