          "_name": "article21",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article021\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#9fe870\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>🌱 How Reprogramming Your Mind Leads to Real Transformation</b></h5>\n                    <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">In PraveenWorld, I teach you how to leverage the power of your subconscious mind to create lasting change in just 15 minutes a day.&nbsp;<div><br></div><div>These aren't just techniques — they are life&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">systems that will transform the way you approach&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">every area of your life:</span></div></h6>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/a2rs19FfhP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            BOOK A  Appointment\n                        </a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                        <ul>\n                            <li><b>🌱 How Reprogramming Your Mind Leads to&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Real Transformation</b></li>\n                        </ul><div><b>💡 Daily Subconscious Rituals&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">I</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">'ll show you daily practices that shift your</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">mindset for success. Not complicated or&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">time-consuming — just powerful, simple rituals&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">to align you with your goals.</span></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>📘 Goal Setting with a Twist&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Learn how to set goals that activate your</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">subconscious mind's GPS. When your mind and&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">heart align — manifesting becomes effortless.</span></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🧠 Abundance &amp; Success Programming</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Uncover hidden beliefs that have been blocking&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">your success. By reprogramming these limiting&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">beliefs, you'll start attracting opportunities&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">that were once out of reach.</span></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>🧘‍♂️ Manifestation + Mind Science&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">A perfect blend of science, NLP, spirituality&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&amp; mindset to help you manifest anything —&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">without chasing it.</span></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>✨ Real &amp; Lasting Results&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">When your subconscious aligns with your desires&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">— your outer world transforms naturally &amp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">effortlessly.</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
