          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>📈 Why Choose Praveen World?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">At Praveen World, we don't just teach — <br>we transform.<br><br>🔹 100% Practical + Spiritual Approach<br>🔹 Just 15 Minutes Daily Practice<br>🔹 Lifetime Tools &amp; Strategies<br>🔹 Personalized 1-on-1 Support<br>🔹 Focused on Real &amp; Lasting Transformation<br>🔹 Online &amp; Offline Sessions Available<br>🔹 10,000+ Lives Transformed Since 2016<br><br>\"<b>This isn't motivation — it's activation.</b>\"<br><br>Our unique approach combines the science of NLP, the depth of spiritual psychology, and proven <br>success frameworks to create real, lasting transformation.</p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">We don't just talk the talk — we walk the walk.<br><br>With Praveen World, you'll:<br>✅ Break free from limiting beliefs<br>✅ Build unshakeable confidence &amp; clarity<br>✅ Develop a powerful success mindset<br>✅ Experience real transformation — not just <br>   temporary motivation<br></p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Join the Praveen World family today and unlock the door to your best life!\n<br>\n<br>It's time to rewrite your story. 🚀</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_cid": "tZInzNsgbT",
          "_anchor": "generic-text-12-tZInzNsgbT",
          "alias": false,
          "_protectedParams": [],
