tps://www.youtube.com/@PraveenWorldNLP?sub_confirmation=1\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a></b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PraveenWorldNLP?sub_confirmation=1\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Join Now</a></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://x.com/copraveenworld\" target=\"_blank\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont m-auto socicon-twitter socicon\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\" style=\"color: rgb(46, 72, 26); fill: rgb(46, 72, 26);\"></span></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><a href=\"https://x.com/copraveenworld\" class=\"text-black\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a></b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><a href=\"https://x.com/copraveenworld\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Join Now</a></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://t.me/PraveenWorldNLP\" target=\"_blank\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont m-auto socicon-telegram socicon\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 135, 165); fill: rgb(119, 135, 165);\"></span></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b><a href=\"https://t.me/PraveenWorldNLP\" class=\"text-info text-primary\"