          "_name": "pricing02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"pricing02\" group=\"Pricing\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n            <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showmainButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false && showCardSubtitle==false && showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Price\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentBg\" condition=\"bg.type === 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle || showmainButton\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                        <b>NLP HELP YOU IN EVERY FIELD OF LIFE</b></h4>\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .mbr-section-head .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n                    </h5>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center item-footer mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showmainButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get Started</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/yec7wb6asdydbtw6gdlf-antalya-beach-lulu-1.jpeg\" alt=\"NLP COACH PRAVEEN \">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>Life Mastery</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">$499</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">1.Change your beliefs.\n<br>2.Control your emotions.\n<br>3.Solve your problems.\n<br>4.program your subconscious mind.\n<br>5.personal counselling.</p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/a2rs19FfhP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Join Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-770x481.jpg\" alt=\"NLP COACH PRAVEEN\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Business Mastery</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">gfh</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">1.Learn to speak the same language as your client.\n<br>2.Motivation and Team Dynamics.\n<br>3.Decision Making.\n<br>4.create results at the level of your subconscious mind.</p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/a2rs19FfhP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Join Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-770x520.jpg\" alt=\"NLP COACH PRAVEEN \">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Wealth Mastery</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">$999</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">1.Know about different types of investment.\n<br>2.Money Psychology.\n<br>3.how to make money?\n<br>4.Elimnate negative beliefs.</p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/a2rs19FfhP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Join Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
