          "_name": "people05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"people05\" group=\"People\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Card</header>\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected=\"\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Name\" name=\"showTitle\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImage\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax=\"\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax=\"\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected=\"\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 mb-0 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>🌿 The Results Speak for Themselves</b></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\tList your customers' testimonials in this block.\n\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">“I was unsure in the beginning, but after following the daily practices, I started feeling more focused and clear in my decisions. Over time, I noticed positive changes in my work and overall mindset.”<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mt-4 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1-160x240.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>— Rekha Sharma, Teacher</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">“The daily rituals are simple yet effective. <br>I experienced better clarity, improved habits, and a more positive outlook towards my goals within a few weeks.”<br><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mt-4 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-2-160x240.jpg\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>— Kiran Sharma, Teacher</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">“I went from feeling stressed and overwhelmed to more calm and in control. These tools helped me improve my thinking and approach towards both life and work.”<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mt-4 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-160x107.jpg\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>— Nikhil Rana, Corporate Professional</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">“One of the biggest changes for me was inner peace and clarity. I now approach situations with more confidence and structured thinking.”<br><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mt-4 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-2-160x107.jpg\" data-slide-to=\"4\" data-bs-slide-to=\"4\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>— Rohit Mehta, Entrepreneur</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">“I always wanted to grow but lacked direction. This program helped me build belief, discipline, and a clearer path forward.”<br><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mt-4 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1-160x107.jpg\" data-slide-to=\"6\" data-bs-slide-to=\"6\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>— Vikram Singh, CA &amp; Trader</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t“After years of confusion, I finally found something that helped me think more clearly and stay consistent. It has improved how I handle both personal and professional challenges.”\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mt-4 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-3-160x240.jpg\" data-slide-to=\"7\" data-bs-slide-to=\"7\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>— Sonal Mehta, HR Manager</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
